{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and take object. If not visible, scan area. Perform task in order to complete. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
